  "description": "In the early hours of the morning, art student Su-Yeon”witnesses a secret involving her classmate Yu-Shin in the studio.\n\n *“You… were a robot?”*\n\nYu-Shin tries to shock Su-Yeon’s head with electricity but fails, and Su-Yeon faints on the spot. That night, Su-Yeon is dragged to Yu-Shin’s house. As her plans with her friend Jae-Hyun go awry, the fates of the three begin to slowly unravel…\n\nA sweet and thrilling campus love triangle featuring young people whose paths keep crossing!\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
